+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Case 1: unknown peers fail closed in both roles.
+// Production call sites: hostchannel.Serve (server.go), hostchannel.Dial
+// (client.go); refusal class via hostchannel.LocalFailure (channel.go).
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
